{"unit_id":"YunLiZeMeng__dsh-window-control#card-zh","repo":"YunLiZeMeng/dsh-window-control","commit":"8f05b09a377f560dc387137f6c2e3237c63bfc6a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-window-control 是面向 DSH 桌面端的窗口控制插件，在设置页加入窗口与退出面板，并由宿主桥接主进程窗口通道。它支持最大化、还原、最小化、全屏和窗口置顶，也可设置启动时自动最大化或全屏。用户可以选择 Esc、双击 Esc 或 Ctrl+Q 退出，并在真正退出前看到确认对话框。适合希望控制 DSH 桌面窗口状态、减少重复调整操作的用户；首次安装桥接后需重启两次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:70","lib/index.js:317"]}
{"unit_id":"YunLiZeMeng__dsh-window-control#card-en","repo":"YunLiZeMeng/dsh-window-control","commit":"8f05b09a377f560dc387137f6c2e3237c63bfc6a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-window-control adds desktop window controls to DSH settings. It can maximize, restore, minimize, toggle fullscreen, and keep the window on top. Choose launch sizing and a quit shortcut; quitting requires confirmation. The host bridge takes effect after two restarts.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:70","lib/index.js:317"]}
